# S64 HTSim validation topology with the same endpoint and link structure as
# s64_64_servers_200g_clos.topo, but a 1 MiB per-link packet buffer.  The
# original HTSim default is eight 4 KiB packets, which drops the first burst
# of a 64-rank group-wide collective before TCP can observe the loss.  This
# validation profile keeps finite queues while separating collective
# correctness from an under-sized default buffer.
Nodes 512
Tiers 2
Podsize 512

Tier 0
Downlink_speed_Gbps 200
Radix_Down 64
Radix_Up 2
Queue_Down 1048576
Queue_Up 1048576
Downlink_Latency_ns 5000
Switch_Latency_ns 0
Oversubscribed 32

Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 200
Radix_Down 8
Queue_Down 1048576
Downlink_Latency_ns 5000
Switch_Latency_ns 0
